{"synopsis":"Manhwa Baru dari Studio DC Webtoon yang juga mengerjakan Leveling With God\nUltimate Martial Divine Demon Dan Woohyun disegel karena dia terlalu kuat untuk ditangani dunia Setelah satu milenium berlalu dia dilepaskan dari segelnya dan merasa semuanya tidak ada artinya saat dia berkeliaran di ganggang belakang  Tepat saat dia jatuh karena dia muak dengan dunia sebuah tangan kecil muncul di depannya Apa ini tanya Dan Woohyun Sebuah pangsit jawabnya Ini adalah pertama kalinya dalam hidupnya ada seseorang yang bersikap baik padanya tanpa niat tersembunyi dan itu mengubah nasibnya Chronicle dari seorang Martial God yang melintasi ribuan tahun ruang dan waktu","alternative_title":"Return of Martial God , 무신귀환록","author":"Myosu","artist":"D&C Webtoon, Leopeu","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"2629f775-68b9-422c-826c-605decdb5269","number":"169","chapter":"169","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"4b45c7e9-d91d-49b8-8608-bf587f21b7b7","number":"168","chapter":"168","title":"","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23"},{"chapter_id":"9730dcd8-b35a-489a-9e2b-5b20c7d6ad0b","number":"167","chapter":"167","title":"","date":"2026-07-15","released":"2026-07-15"},{"chapter_id":"466652c3-9b48-4c08-89a5-274774bde92a","number":"166","chapter":"166","title":"","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08"},{"chapter_id":"bd4603dc-6178-4cb8-bfc7-0384e49e1b80","number":"165","chapter":"165","title":"","date":"2026-06-24","released":"2026-06-24"},{"chapter_id":"edf91732-f705-47ff-a246-d4b98394c038","number":"164","chapter":"164","title":"","date":"2026-06-18","released":"2026-06-18"},{"chapter_id":"4c4c9ad5-df24-4d44-aab2-e4e6a2986120","number":"163","chapter":"163","title":"","date":"2026-06-10","released":"2026-06-10"},{"chapter_id":"538f2b2b-5a2f-4717-8a55-ff766e07cba6","number":"162","chapter":"162","title":"","date":"2026-06-04","released":"2026-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"c576de1e-b438-4f7c-91bc-2ce4355c9ceb","number":"161","chapter":"161","title":